    "intro_html":  "Roasted sweet potato cubes under taco-seasoned turkey simmered in salsa, finished with sour cream, cheese, and cilantro. Each bowl brings \u003cstrong\u003e{{protein}} grams of protein\u003c/strong\u003e for about \u003cstrong\u003e${{cost_ps}}\u003c/strong\u003e (at everyday cost). Sweet, smoky, savory, and cheaper than anything with the word bowl on a menu.",
